OL,3,GNEWSA'I carried a gingerbread biscuit
OL,4,A4,650 miles to eat on Everest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who set himself a challenge to
OL,7,Ftake a piece of gingerbread from West
OL,8,FLancashire to Everest said it was "the
OL,9,Fbest thing I've tasted in a long time"
OL,10,Fwhen he finally got to eat it at Base
OL,11,FCamp.
OL,13,FChris Vincent, from Ormskirk, reached
OL,14,Fbase camp with nine others on 15
OL,15,FOctober and finally ate the gingerbread
OL,16,Fafter carrying it in his bag for almost
OL,17,Ftwo weeks and about 4,650 miles (7,500
OL,18,Fkm) to Nepal.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
