OL,3,GNEWSA'I carried a gingerbread biscuit
OL,4,A4,650 miles to eat on Everest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 62-year-old said it was the
OL,7,Fexperience of a lifetime to climb the
OL,8,Fmountain and something he had always
OL,9,Fwanted to do.
OL,11,FHe raised over #5,000 for the Steve
OL,12,FPrescott Foundation, that supports Try
OL,13,FAssist, previously known as the Rugby
OL,14,FLeague Benevolent Fund and The Christie
OL,15,Fcancer hospital.
